ass=\"message\">...and you are just going to take &quot;answer&quot; from Arcana me and my cabal aren't going to have. That's not gonna fly.</div> </div> </div> </div>You're getting to make your character, and you know what, Fata-Ku, Romulus, give me an arcana spread for a character, 1 each, same rules as I gave Archon. Those will be his cabal mates.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2309-ashenrogue","name":"Ashenrogue","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2309_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1388"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-16T13:46:15-07:00","id":1063463,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dark Archon</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1063365-time-magic-ultimate-mystery-solver?p=1063374#post1063374\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Even if killer is another mage? How the hell they can kill each other then, if tracking the killer down is trivial? How do Banishers without Time Magic even exist?</div> </div> </div> </div>To answer the first two questions I point to <i>The Door,</i> the short story in form of text between chapters, with all its implications. (Seems really really hard to get away with even an indirect murder in Mage society because of Time magic &lt;and other very basic magic&gt;, with the caveat people have to bother to investigate) Also I remember that core says <u>most</u> Banishers die early and fast ( Edit: Just checked, I was correct see Page 236 MtA)<br /> <br /> So a chronicle with flippant or even casual mage vs mage murder is obviously not grounded in the mechanical or thematic realities of the setting and game. Murdering another mage is something no mage should really expect to get away with, making murder much more a serious choice, or an unthinking act they'll reasonably expect to be punished for.<br /> <br /> Seer vs Pentacle is more of a shadow war than murder, and a lot of multi-mage resources and talent are spent on counter-intelligence on both sides when it becomes a hot shadow war, as opposed to a cold shadow war.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><i>\u201cYouth ages, immaturity is outgrown, ignorance can be educated, and drunkenness sobered, but stupid lasts forever.\u201d </i>~ <b>Aristophanes</b><br /> <i>&quot;Virescit Vulnere Virtus&quot;</i> ~ <b>Stewart Clan Motto</b></div> <div align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/801713-homebrew-of-pale_crusader\" target=\"_blank\">Frailty Chronicles</a></span><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/801713-homebrew-of-pale_crusader\" target=\"_blank\">;</a><b><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/801713-homebrew-of-pale_crusader\" target=\"_blank\">Understanding the power of limitations.</a></b></div>","edited":{"userid":3279,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3279-pale_crusader","user":"Pale_Crusader","date":". 03-16-2017, 05:21 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3279-pale_crusader","name":"Pale_Crusader","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3279_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun